{
  "id": "6aaffc8288573db4ad00e09d",
  "title": "Jev",
  "created": 1789918340,
  "updated": 1789918601,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8288573db4ad00e09d",
      "text": "Jev",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918340,
      "updated": 1789918340
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8600000000000fffc7",
      "text": "概要",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918340,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffc8",
      "text": " 開発元は[TypeSafe AI]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918371
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffca100000000000fffea",
      "text": " 創業者の[Diogo Almeida]は元OpenAIで、ChatGPTの共同発明者とされる [DataCamp https://www.datacamp.com/blog/system-one-models-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918368,
      "updated": 1789918375
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffc9",
      "text": " TypeSafeは「[System One]」モデルと呼んでおり、名前はDaniel Kahnemanが『[ファスト&スロー]』で広めた概念に由来する [TypeSafe AI https://docs.typesafe.ai/concepts/system-one]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918398
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffca",
      "text": " テキスト生成用のLLMではなく、判断に特化したモデル。公式は「非構造化の状態を入れると、型付きの確率的判断が返る関数呼び出し」と位置づけている [Typesafe https://typesafe.ai/blog/introducing-system-one-models-and-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc9c00000000000fffe9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918363,
      "updated": 1789918363
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffcb",
      "text": "入出力",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffcc",
      "text": " 状態（コンテキスト）とそれに関する質問を送る形式。回答はnoul・choice・scoreの3種で、確率と信頼度が付く [GitHub https://github.com/fiale-plus/jev-cli]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffcd",
      "text": " 入力はテキストのみで、文字列・JSONオブジェクト・テキスト配列を受け付ける。画像・音声・動画は現時点で非対応 [TypeSafe AI https://docs.typesafe.ai/concepts/system-one]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffce",
      "text": " 複数の質問を1回の呼び出しにまとめると、1問ずつ聞くより12.2倍安く10倍速く、回答も同一だったと公式cookbookで報告されている [DEV Community https://dev.to/valyuai/how-to-use-jev-a-practical-guide-to-typesafes-system-one-model-g5e]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffcdd00000000000fffeb",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918428,
      "updated": 1789918428
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffcf",
      "text": "仕組み・学習（公表範囲）",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918428
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd0",
      "text": " 新アーキテクチャと並列サンプラーで、自己回帰ではなく1回のクエリで全出力を生成する [DataCamp https://www.datacamp.com/blog/system-one-models-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd1",
      "text": " 学習手法は[RLCD]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918438
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffce700000000000fffec",
      "text": "  人間の好みを報酬にする[RLHF]とは違い、確率が実際の結果と一致するように最適化する",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918438,
      "updated": 1789918511
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd3000000000000fffee",
      "text": "  90%と出した回答が全体として約90%当たるように較正する",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918511,
      "updated": 1789918528
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd4100000000000fffef",
      "text": "  [DataCamp https://www.datacamp.com/blog/system-one-models-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918528,
      "updated": 1789918530
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd2",
      "text": " 較正は予測の集団で測るもので、個々の回答が正しいことは保証しない [TypeSafe AI https://docs.typesafe.ai/concepts/system-one]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd4f00000000000ffff0",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918542,
      "updated": 1789918542
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd3",
      "text": "性能・価格（同社の自己申告）",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd4",
      "text": " 応答時間は約70〜500ms、同等のLLMワークフロー比で20〜200倍速く、40〜400倍安いとされる [The Neuron https://www.theneuron.ai/explainer-articles/typesafe-jev-system-one-models-explained/]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd5",
      "text": " 構造化出力のエラー率0%と主張 [DataCamp https://www.datacamp.com/blog/system-one-models-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd6",
      "text": " 入力トークンは10億あたり42ドル、出力トークンは無料 [MindStudio https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/jev-system-one-model-launch]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd5300000000000ffff1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918545,
      "updated": 1789918546
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd7",
      "text": "提供形態",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd8",
      "text": " 2026年9月中旬時点でウェイトリスト制のアーリーアクセス",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918557
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd5f00000000000ffff3",
      "text": " HTTP API（POST /v1/systemone、モデル名jev-latest）と公式のPython・JavaScript SDKで利用できる [DataCamp https://www.datacamp.com/blog/system-one-models-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918557,
      "updated": 1789918557
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd5b00000000000ffff2",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918554,
      "updated": 1789918554
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffd9",
      "text": "できないこと",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffda",
      "text": " 返信文の作成、コード生成、文書要約、推論過程の説明はできない [Flavio Copes https://flaviocopes.com/jev/]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffdb",
      "text": " 算術や日付比較もできず、アプリ側のバリデーションの代替にもならない。決定的な処理はコードに残し、意味的な判断にJevを使うのが推奨 [GitHub https://github.com/tumf/jev-cli]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd6d00000000000ffff4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918571,
      "updated": 1789918571
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffdc",
      "text": "エコシステム（公開から数日で多数出現）",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918571
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffdd",
      "text": " 非公式CLI、MCPサーバー、コードレビュー、ブラウザ操作エージェントなど",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffde",
      "text": " LangChainにはJevで難易度を判定し、使うモデルを切り替えるルーティング用ミドルウェアがある [LangChain https://www.langchain.com/blog/building-a-harness-with-jev]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffdf",
      "text": " [openjev]は4Bのオープンモデルのlogitから1回のforwardで選択肢の確率を読み出すが、再現しているのはインターフェースのパターンだけで、Jevのモデルや学習ではないと明記している [DEV Community https://dev.to/valyuai/how-to-use-jev-a-practical-guide-to-typesafes-system-one-model-g5e]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918601
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe0",
      "text": " 公式デモはMinecraftボット、自動運転風シミュレーション、ドローンの障害物コース走行などの[リアルタイム制御]が中心 [MindStudio https://www.mindstudio.ai/blog/jev-system-one-model-launch]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918592
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffd7a00000000000ffff5",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918584,
      "updated": 1789918584
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe1",
      "text": "不明点・注意点",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918584
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe2",
      "text": " アーキテクチャの詳細は未開示で、オープンウェイトの言語モデルがベースではないかという外部の推測もある [mezha https://mezha.net/eng/news/d559e594_typesafe_ai_unveils/]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe3",
      "text": " 学習データやRLCDの報酬設計（結果ラベルの出どころ）も不明",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe4",
      "text": " 「ハルシネーションしない」はスキーマ外の値を返さないという意味にすぎず、判断自体の誤りは起こる",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe5",
      "text": " 速度・コスト・精度の数字はいずれも同社発表で、第三者による検証はまだ少ない",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8800000000000fffe6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918342,
      "updated": 1789918342
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc8d00000000000fffe7",
      "text": "[Claude.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918347,
      "updated": 1789918352
    },
    {
      "id": "6aaffc9100000000000fffe8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1789918351,
      "updated": 1789918351
    }
  ]
}